# Recipe-scraping pipeline: raw scraper code and its captured live-page test
# fixtures stay local-only per the human's 2026-07-19 licensing decision
# (hobby scope; only the prepared/processed corpus in data/processed/ is
# committed). Still present on disk; removed from history via git
# filter-branch (2026-07-19, before first push) and have never been
# committed to the public repo. See docs/BACKLOG.md.
app/services/recipe_scraping/
scripts/scrape_recipe_pages.py
tests/test_recipe_scraping.py
tests/fixtures/scrape/

# Corpus-expansion candidate-id scraper (2026-07-25, task A2): imports
# directly from the local-only app/services/recipe_scraping/ package above,
# so it's the same "raw scraper code" class and stays local-only for the
# same reason -- never becomes the one piece of this pipeline that leaks
# into the tracked tree.
scripts/scrape_candidate_ids.py
tests/test_scrape_candidate_ids.py

